In your first thread Patric replied:
>> I think that's not what usually gets called "unbalanced" [...]

I like to add that it would be interesting, instead of only listing
your ideas, to provide some rationale why you think a concrete change
would be a good idea, and what concrete deficiency you want to address
with your proposal.

Why that, you may ask? Because Nethack is a complex game where a lot
effort went into balancing it. Changes should be well thought through,
and side effects considered. What may look plausible from one point of
view may seem bad from another.

Various variants have already taken the path to "fix" some issues with
vanilla Nethack while still maintaining (or increasing) the balance;
have you inspected the designs those games (Unnethack, Spork) made?

